  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "Scraper refinements (slides 1-19)",
  "description": "Code walkthrough for the registration refresh, scraper side. Step N matches slide N of the deck. Pinned to ffe35d6 (PR #10 head, the commit apo-mcp-server v1.1.0-rc12 to rc14 pin).",
